  intros msF1 mo1 KR1 MP1 VIS1. rewrite HRe in VIS1. clear HRe.
  clear S1 S2 S3 A10 A11 HmsT Hms Hlf HR' G2 G8 G9 G10 G11 G12 G13 G14 G18 G19 G20 G21 G22 G23 G24 FHF R'.
  pose proof (ah_mpres_trans H HH _ _ _ MP MP1) as MP01.
  pose proof TS2 as (MI2' & ST2 & ERR2 & RA2 & AC2 & RF2 & S02 & RH2 & FR2 & AD12 & AD22 & USH2 & XP2 & OWN2).
  assert (GZ12 : gz M2 o1 40) by (intros i Hi; eapply sh0_of_addressable; [exact AD12 | change (8 * (40 / 8)) with 40; lia]).
  assert (GZ22 : gz M2 o2 40) by (intros i Hi; eapply sh0_of_addressable; [exact AD22 | change (8 * (40 / 8)) with 40; lia]).
  destruct (hdr40_split _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ HD1M) as (P0b & P8b & P16b & P24b & P32b & P36b).
  destruct (hdr40_split _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ HD2M) as (Q0b & Q8b & Q16b & Q24b & Q32b & Q36b).
  clear GZ1 GZ2.
  lazymatch type of VIS1 with _ = MS ?T _ _ _ _ _ _ => remember T as R2 eqn:HR2 end.
